  "bodyHash": "d62d77835cd074b0",
  "content": "\n\n<h1><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Wicked Worldguard Mod</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">一款適用於 Forge 1.20.1 伺服器、類似 WorldGuard 的區域保護模組。</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">基本使用方法</span></h2>\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\">建立區域</span></span></h3>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">設定位置 1：&nbsp;<code>/rg pos1</code>&nbsp;（將位置設為當前所在位置）</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">設定位置 2：&nbsp;<code>/rg pos2</code>&nbsp;（將位置設為當前所在位置）</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">建立區域：&nbsp;<code>/rg define &lt;name&gt;</code>&nbsp;（例如：&nbsp;<code>/rg define myhouse</code>）</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">或者，您可以使用木製鎬：<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_061d6a3b-802c-4676-bd87-aa00da99deef.png\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">左鍵點擊方塊以設定位置 1。</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">右鍵點擊方塊以設定位置 2。</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">接著執行&nbsp;<code>/rg define &lt;name&gt;</code></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2c762578-5322-413f-9664-ca3f42ad74fc.png\" width=\"474\" height=\"41\"></span></span></h3>\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\">設定旗標</span></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">旗標用於控制區域內允許的行為。預設情況下，區域允許所有操作。請使用「拒絕（deny）」來限制特定動作。</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">破壞方塊：&nbsp;<code>/rg flag &lt;region&gt; block-break deny</code></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">放置方塊：&nbsp;<code>/rg flag &lt;region&gt; block-place deny</code></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">互動：&nbsp;<code>/rg flag &lt;region&gt; interact deny</code></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">PvP：&nbsp;<code>/rg flag &lt;region&gt; pvp deny</code></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">生物生成：&nbsp;<code>/rg flag &lt;region&gt; mob-spawning deny</code></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">拒絕（deny）旗標適用於所有玩家，包含區域擁有者。</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\">管理區域</span></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">列出區域：&nbsp;<code>/rg list</code></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">取得區域資訊：&nbsp;<code>/rg info &lt;region&gt;</code></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">刪除區域：&nbsp;<code>/rg remove &lt;region&gt;</code></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\">擁有者與成員管理</span></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">新增擁有者：&nbsp;<code>/rg addowner &lt;region&gt; &lt;playername&gt;</code>&nbsp;（擁有者可進行建造與修改旗標）</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">新增成員：&nbsp;<code>/rg addmember &lt;region&gt; &lt;playername&gt;</code>&nbsp;（成員可進行建造但無法修改旗標）</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">移除擁有者：&nbsp;<code>/rg removeowner &lt;region&gt; &lt;playername&gt;</code></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">移除成員：&nbsp;<code>/rg removemember &lt;region&gt; &lt;playername&gt;</code></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">注意：目前拒絕（deny）旗標適用於所有人，無論其擁有者或成員身分為何。</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">進階功能（尚未實作）</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">全域區域（<strong>global</strong>）</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">更多旗標：creeper-explosion, tnt, use, chest-access, invincible</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">歡迎與告別訊息</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">皮革檢查工具</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">指令摘要</span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><code>/rg pos1</code>&nbsp;- 將位置 1 設為當前所在位置</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><code>/rg pos2</code>&nbsp;- 將位置 2 設為當前所在位置</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><code>/rg define &lt;name&gt;</code>&nbsp;- 使用選定位置建立區域</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><code>/rg flag &lt;region&gt; &lt;flag&gt; &lt;value&gt;</code>&nbsp;- 設定旗標（例如：deny）</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><code>/rg list</code>&nbsp;- 列出所有區域</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><code>/rg info &lt;region&gt;</code>&nbsp;- 顯示區域詳細資訊</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><code>/rg remove &lt;region&gt;</code>&nbsp;- 刪除區域</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><code>/rg addowner &lt;region&gt; &lt;player&gt;</code>&nbsp;- 新增擁有者</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><code>/rg addmember &lt;region&gt; &lt;player&gt;</code>&nbsp;- 新增成員</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><code>/rg removeowner &lt;region&gt; &lt;player&gt;</code>&nbsp;- 移除擁有者</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><code>/rg removemember &lt;region&gt; &lt;player&gt;</code>&nbsp;- 移除成員</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">注意事項</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">區域是由兩個位置定義的長方體範圍。</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">旗標會依照區域優先級順序檢查（較小的區域會覆蓋較大的區域）。</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">此模組僅在伺服器端運作。</span></li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
